# The context menu on an edge of the solid that no entity draws: the
# upright edge of testdata/topo/slot.tlspr that ext_chamfer_solid_edge
# picks, right-clicked, offers the features that take edges, and Fillet
# Edges from it makes the same group the Features menu does.
file $testdata/topo/slot.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
move 335 425
popup Fillet Edges
down R 335 425
up R 335 425
dump
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
